control: A stale subject is masked again under the scanner in force, each mask recorded under it
removes: a masking event is recorded with no scanner version or revision
packages: ./backfill ./backfill/internal/pass1
tests: TestAChangeOfScannerMasksAndScansAgain
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

